{"assets":["/statement-assets/15cfefcb81032969eb2e5fd14816a6412919b3980860ae296eccc0ae652299cf.png","/statement-assets/d4c84d7a5e1a239fa6d841c6da61aa4ea73f1c6cbdc794a592b01b243dd9cc84.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1534","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Lost Tree"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an interactive problem"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Little Dormi was faced with an awkward problem at the carnival: he has to guess the edges of an unweighted tree of $$$n$$$ nodes! The nodes of the tree are numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The game master only allows him to ask one type of question:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Little Dormi picks a node $$$r$$$ ($$$1 \\le r \\le n$$$), and the game master will reply with an array $$$d_1, d_2, \\ldots, d_n$$$, where $$$d_i$$$ is the length of the shortest path from node $$$r$$$ to $$$i$$$, for all $$$1 \\le i \\le n$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additionally, to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"make the game unfair"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" challenge Little Dormi the game master will allow at most $$$\\lceil\\frac{n}{2}\\rceil$$$ questions, where $$$\\lceil x \\rceil$$$ denotes the smallest integer greater than or equal to $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Faced with the stomach-churning possibility of not being able to guess the tree, Little Dormi needs your help to devise a winning strategy!"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that the game master creates the tree before the game starts, and does not change it during the game."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains the integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2\\,000$$$), the number of nodes in the tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You will then begin interaction."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"When your program has found the tree, first output a line consisting of a single \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"!"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" followed by $$$n-1$$$ lines each with two space separated integers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$, denoting an edge connecting nodes $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ ($$$1 \\le a, b \\le n$$$). Once you are done, terminate your program normally immediately after flushing the output stream."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You may output the edges in any order and an edge $$$(a,b)$$$ is considered the same as an edge $$$(b,a)$$$. Answering is not considered as a query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"custom","title":"Interaction"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Interaction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After taking input, you may make at most $$$\\lceil\\frac{n}{2}\\rceil$$$ queries. Each query is made in the format \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"? r"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", where $$$r$$$ is an integer $$$1 \\le r \\le n$$$ that denotes the node you want to pick for that query."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You will then receive $$$n$$$ space separated integers $$$d_1, d_2, \\ldots, d_n$$$, where $$$d_i$$$ is the length of the shortest path from node $$$r$$$ to $$$i$$$, followed by a newline."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After printing a query do not forget to output end of line and flush the output. Otherwise, you will get "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idleness limit exceeded"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". To do this, use:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fflush(stdout)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in C++; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"System.out.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Java; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"flush(output)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Pascal; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"stdout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Python; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" see documentation for other languages. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If at any point you make an invalid query or try to make more than $$$\\lceil \\frac{n}{2} \\rceil$$$ queries, the interaction will terminate immediately and you will receive a Wrong Answer verdict."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacks"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To hack a solution, use the following format."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2\\,000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$n−1$$$ lines contain two integers $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$ ($$$1 \\le u,v \\le n$$$) denoting an edge between $$$u$$$ and $$$v$$$ ($$$u \\neq v$$$). These $$$n-1$$$ edges must form a tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n\n0 1 2 2\n\n1 0 1 1"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n? 1\n\n? 2\n\n!\n4 2\n1 2\n2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n\n2 2 1 1 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n? 5\n\n!\n4 5\n3 5\n2 4\n1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here is the tree from the first example."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/15cfefcb81032969eb2e5fd14816a6412919b3980860ae296eccc0ae652299cf.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Notice that the edges can be output in any order."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additionally, here are the answers for querying every single node in example $$$1$$$:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$: $$$[0,1,2,2]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$2$$$: $$$[1,0,1,1]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$3$$$: $$$[2,1,0,2]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$4$$$: $$$[2,1,2,0]$$$"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Below is the tree from the second example interaction."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/d4c84d7a5e1a239fa6d841c6da61aa4ea73f1c6cbdc794a592b01b243dd9cc84.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Lastly, here are the answers for querying every single node in example $$$2$$$:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$: $$$[0,4,1,3,2]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$2$$$: $$$[4,0,3,1,2]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$3$$$: $$$[1,3,0,2,1]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$4$$$: $$$[3,1,2,0,1]$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$5$$$: $$$[2,2,1,1,0]$$$"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1534D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1534/problem/D"}